#: ../../site/performance.md:1
msgid "Performance method and limits"
msgstr "性能方法与局限"

#: ../../site/performance.md:3
msgid ""
"Performance claims must state the workload, data scale, CPU/thread settings, "
"environment, statistic and noise handling. The native library and the Python "
"reference are different implementations; a throughput comparison is not a "
"claim of Python API equivalence."
msgstr ""
"性能声明必须说明工作负载、数据规模、CPU/线程设置、运行环境、统计量和噪声处理"
"方式。原生库与 Python 参考实现是两种不同的实现；吞吐量比较并不等同于声明 "
"Python API 等价。"

#: ../../site/performance.md:8
msgid ""
"The repository's acceptance records contain the raw benchmark method and "
"dated results. The Iteration 9 and alpha003 records explicitly preserve "
"INCONCLUSIVE outcomes; do not summarize a noisy run as a stable speedup. "
"Historical CSV and HTML benchmarks use different workloads and are not "
"interchangeable."
msgstr ""
"仓库的验收记录包含原始基准测试方法和带日期的结果。Iteration 9 和 alpha003 记"
"录明确保留了 INCONCLUSIVE（无定论）结果；不要将有噪声的运行总结为稳定的加速"
"比。历史 CSV 和 HTML 基准使用不同的工作负载，不能互换。"

#: ../../site/performance.md:14
msgid ""
"For a reproducible run, use the committed benchmark source and the "
"documented data preparation steps. Large generated results are not part of "
"the docs site."
msgstr ""
"如需可复现的运行，请使用已提交的基准测试源码和文档中说明的数据准备步骤。大型"
"生成结果不属于文档站点的一部分。"
